:: Pub Approach Widgets [widget]

<<widget "pubapproach">>
	<<set $xchange.pubtimer to random(10,30)>><<set $pubdrink to 0>><<set $pubresist to 1>>
	<<generate1>><<person1>>

	<span class="purple"><<= $pub_tf? "Having witnessed your transformation just now, a": "A">> <<person>> approaches you.</span><br>
	"<<print [
		`Hey, ${$player.gender_appearance is "f"? "girl" : "boy"}! You look cute. But I suspect that's the least interesting thing about you,`,
		`Hey, cutie! What's your name?`,
		`Hey, ${$NPCList[0].gender is "m"? "my cock just died. May I bury it in your ass?" : "my plumbing's a bit leaky. Would you care to check it out for me?"}`,
		`Excuse me, I couldn't help but notice you look an awful lot like my next ${$player.gender_appearance is "f"? "girl": "boy"},`,
		"Hey, babe! Why don't you sit on my lap and we talk about the first thing that pops up.",
		"Hey, my hands are cold. May I warm them in your pants?",
		"Do you know what winks and fucks like a tiger?",
		"If I said you have a nice body, would you hold it against me?",
		"Wanna know how I know we are having sex tonight? I'm stronger than you,",
		`You look killer in ${$worn.lower.plural? "those":"that"} ${$worn.lower.name}. Care to share some of that booty?`,
		`I just can't look at you and breathe at the same time... You're just that stunning,`,
		`${$player.gender_appearance is "f"? "Nice legs. What time do they open?": "Hey there, postman... Do you have a package for me?"}`,
		"You know, if I were you, I’d have sex with me. Immediately,",
	].random()>>".
	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 800>><<arousal 500>><<ggarousal>><<elseif $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 400>><<arousal 200>><<garousal>><</if>>
	<<unset $pub_tf>>
	<br><br>

	<<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">>
	<<link [[Flirt (0:10)|Pub Approach Flirt]]>><<pass 10>><<handheldon>><</link>><<promiscuous2>>
	<br>
	<<if $arousal lt $arousalmax * 2/5 and $drunk lt 240>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><</link>>
	<<elseif $willpowerSuccess>>
		<<link [[Reject (0:01)|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<pass 1>><<willpowersuccess>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<set $pubresist to 0>>
		<span class="lewd">You're too <<= $arousal gte $arousalmax * 2/5? "horny" : "drunk">> to resist <<his>> advances.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<</widget>>

:: Pub Approach Flirt
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<set $bus to "harvest">>
<<promiscuity2>>
You smile to <<his>> approach, encouraging <<him>> to continue. Time goes by swiftly as you both chat. "You know, you really are quite a <<= $player.gender_appearance is "f" ? ["sexy chick", "hot girl", "attractive babe", "sex bomb", "sweet piece of tail"].random() : ["handsome guy", "sexy hunk of ass", "hot stud", "stallion"].random()>>. <<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "" : "I-">>I'd love taking somebody like you home," <<he>> shoots off <<his>> lusty proposal. "<<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "" : "I-">>If you'll allow it."  
<br><br>

<<switch $speech_attitude>>
<<case "meek">>
	"I-I wouldn't mind...," you meekly respond while contemplating in your mind the extent of the depravity about to befall your poor little self. Despite the countless lewd fantasies rapidly coursing through your head, or perhaps precisely because of them, you still decide to follow <<him>> out.
<<case "neutral">>
	"I thought you'd never ask," you say while mockingly faking surprise. "Come on, let's go." There isn't much to think about, so you just follow <<him>> out.
<<case "bratty">>
	"You're just gonna stand there? Come on, get moving!" you energetically respond. "This <<= $player.sex is "f"? "girl":"boy">> isn't gonna service <<pherself>>." The <<person>> is stunned for a moment before your boldness. A few moments pass, yet against <<his>> better judgement <<he>> still follows you out.
<</switch>>
<br><br>

Perhaps it's <<his>> <<= $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500? "charisma" : "cute awkwardness">>, or perhaps you're just horny. But either way, <<hes>> managed to get through your defences and convince you to accompany <<him>> home.
<br><br>

<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
	<<He>> drives you to <<his>> place at Danube Street without haste. <<He>> takes <<his>> time opening the door. You follow <<him>> through, right into a seemingly fancy room. Yet you barely hear a word before <<hes>> dropped all pretense to push you down and get on top of you. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Pub Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<He>> drives you to <<his>> place at Domus Street. Shakily, <<he>> opens the door, struggling to contain <<himself>>. The door yields. And you've barely managed to enter the hall before you're suddenly backed into a wall, getting groped all over.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next (0:10)|Pub Approach Sex]]>><<set $phase to 2>><<set $sexstart to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

