:: Pub Approach Sex Finish

<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>>
<<if $phase is 1>>
	<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>
		<<tearful>> you knock <<him>> onto <<his>> bed and dash out the room, down the stairs and out onto the street.

	<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>

		<<ejaculation>>

		"I really, really needed that," <<he>> says, stroking your hair. "Let's keep this between just the two of us, though." <<He>> glances at <<his>> watch. "My spouse should be returning home any time soon. So I better hurry up and scrub your scent off myself." <<He>> opens a door for you to get out. "Really sorry about the rush. I promise I won't forget you." <<tearful>> you leave the house.		

	<<else>>

		"Alright. I knew I was out of practice. Just go so I can wash up before my spouse returns." <<He>> opens the door for you to leave. <<tearful>> you leave the house.

	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>

	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Danube Street]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<if $enemyhealth lte 0>>

		<<tearful>> you knock <<him>> back against one of the doors. It gives way and <<he>> tumbles out, letting you escape before <<he>> can get back up.

	<<elseif $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>

		<<ejaculation>>

		"That was amazing," <<he>> pants. "You really are an incredible fuck." <<He>> rolls onto <<his>> side to face you. "Honestly, I'd really like for you to stay. Can I offer you some coffee? Perhaps tea?" You tell <<him>> there's no need for it and that you really should be going.
		<br><br>

		"Name's <<personname>>," <<he>> suddenly introduces <<himself>> out of the blue as if hoping this was more than a one night stand. "I really hope we'll see each other again." Not sparing another word, you quickly dress back up, and apologise for not being able to stay. <<tearful>> you leave the room. Yet <<he>> still stares after you in longing all the way until you're fully gone.
		
	<<else>>

		"Huh? What's wrong?" <<he>> asks. "Ugh, nevermind. This was a mistake. Please leave." <<tearful>> you leave <<him>> in peace.

	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>

	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Domus Street]]>><</link>>
<</if>>


:: Pub Approach Reject
<<if $phase is 1>>
	Unimpressed, you shoot down every single one of <<his>> poor attempts at a pick-up line. Mortified that <<he>> would think such cheesy lines would work on you. And somehow, <<he>> still looks shocked that <<his>> clever oneliners missed their mark.
	<br><br>

	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 500>>
		"Come on! Don't be like that!" <<he>> protests. "At least let me buy you a drink."
		<br><br>
		<<if playerIsPregnant() and playerAwareTheyArePregnant()>>
			<span class="blue">You can't bring yourself to drink while you know you're with child.</span>
			<br>
			<<link [[Refuse|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
		<<else>>
			<<link [[Accept (0:20)|Pub Approach Drink]]>><<alcohol 200>><<pass 20>><<set $pubdrink += 2000>><</link>><<ggalcohol>>
			<br>
			<<willpowerdifficulty 1 1000 "silent">>
			<<if $arousal lt $arousalmax * 0.4 and $drunk lt 240>>
				<<link [[Refuse|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
			<<elseif $willpowerSuccess and $pubresist>>
				<<link [[Refuse|Pub Approach Reject]]>><<willpowersuccess>><<set $phase++>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				<<set $pubresist to 0>>
				<span class="lewd"><<He>> has worn you down. You're now going along with <<his>> advances.</span>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<br>
	<<else>>
		Having run out of ammunition, the <<person>> takes <<his>> leave feeling defeated.
		<br>
		<<link [[Next|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	Despite <<his>> pushiness, you still refuse every attempt <<he>> does to get you to cave. 
	<<if $NPCList[0].skills.security gte 750>>
		For a moment it seems the <<person>> is about to lose <<his>> temper, but a stern reminder from Landry across the hall appears to scare the <<person>> off. With a scornful expression, <<he>> clicks <<his>> tongue one last time before going off. 
	<<else>>
		Having knocked out the wind out of <<him>>, <<he>> makes one last scornful remark befor going off.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Pub]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>

